    <item>
      <title>欧盟与印度尼西亚签署具有里程碑意义的贸易协议</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261122-202703&amp;cat=global&amp;event=evt_3a63d9db4d75</link>
